e,v=ev(74,'40–43','As Śūrasena’s emissaries report, Sundarī’s radiant divine vehicle passes. Her gaze falls on Indra’s craft; contact with her vehicle’s air raises it before amazed onlookers and divine sages. Indra actually reaches Amarāvatī and the others return to their places. This is the enacted ending of the earlier fallen-vimāna question, not the refused proposal to transfer her merit.',[('Śūrasena',F),('Śūrasena royal messengers','FAMILY'),(SU,F),('Sundarī rescue vimāna','VAHANA'),('Indra',D),('Indra stalled vimāna','VAHANA'),('Amarāvatī',L),('Divine sages','FAMILY')],story='gup4-story-vimana-frame',outcome='Indra’s craft actually flies and he returns to Amarāvatī; the earlier frame’s missing flight remedy/return is now present.')
